org/details/ase-2025/ase-2025-papers/131/Why-AI-Agents-Still-Need-You-Findings-from-Developer-Agent-Collaborations-in-the-Wil\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-20d46d4e-35fb-47ad-9fa5-d2c5311aef98').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
